'\" t
.\" kushare-tui manual page (English; installed as the default page). The
.\" Spanish one is ../es/kushare-tui.1. Keys come from
.\" src/bin/kushare-tui/app.rs (on_key) and the tui.keys_* translation keys:
.\" keep them in sync.
.TH KUSHARE\-TUI 1 "2026-11-25" "kushare" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kushare\-tui \- terminal interface for kushare
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kushare\-tui
.RB [ \-\-screen
.IR TAB ]
.RB [ \-\-send
.IR FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kushare\-tui
is the terminal interface of
.BR kushare (1),
with the same features as
.BR kushare\-gui (1):
phone status, messages, calls, notifications, clipboard, devices, file sending,
webcam, microphone and QR scanner.
.PP
It is a D-Bus client of the daemon: if the daemon is not running it says so and
connects as soon as it starts. Commands apply to the first paired phone that is
connected.
.PP
Logs go to
.I $TMPDIR/kushare\-tui.log
.RI ( /tmp/kushare\-tui.log )
so they do not break the terminal drawing.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-screen " TAB"
Initial tab:
.BR home ", " phone ", " messages ", " calls ", " notifications ,
.BR clipboard ", " devices ", " send ", " camera " or " qr .
.TP
.BI \-\-send " FILE"
Open the
.B Send
tab with that file selected.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH TABS
.TS
tab(@);
rB lB l.
1@Home@overview of the phone and the PC
2@Phone@battery, ringer, call and media
3@Messages@SMS conversations
4@Calls@call log and dialer
5@Notifications@those currently on the phone
6@Clipboard@shared history
7@Devices@paired devices and search
8@Send@a file to the phone
9@Camera & mic@webcam and microphone
0@QR codes@scanner and history
.TE
.SH KEYS
.SS In every tab
.TP 16
.BR Tab ", " "\(<- \(->" ", " 1 \- 9 ", " 0
Switch tab.
.TP
.BR "\(ua \(da" ", " "j k"
Move through the list.
.TP
.B Enter
Open or use the selected item.
.TP
.B r
Reload.
.TP
.B Space
Play or pause.
.TP
.BR "< >" " (or " ", ." )
Previous or next track.
.TP
.B f
Ring the phone to find it; press
.B f
again to stop.
.TP
.BR "H " / " A " / " M"
During a call: hang up, answer (when ringing) and mute the microphone.
.TP
.BR q ", " Ctrl+C
Quit.
.SS Phone
.TP 16
.BR "n v s"
Ringer normal, vibrate or silent.
.TP
.BR "a h m"
Answer, hang up (or reject when ringing) and mute the microphone.
.SS Messages
.TP 16
.B Enter
Open the conversation.
.TP
.B w
Write a reply (with the conversation open).
.TP
.B Esc
Back to the list.
.SS Calls
.TP 16
.B Enter
Call the selected number.
.TP
.B d
Type a number and dial it.
.TP
.BR 0 \- 9 ", " "* #"
In a call: DTMF tones.
.SS Notifications
.TP 16
.BR x ", " Delete
Dismiss the selected one.
.TP
.B X
Dismiss them all.
.TP
.B Enter
Trigger its action.
.TP
.B w
Reply (if the app allows it).
.SS Clipboard
.TP 16
.B Enter
Copy the entry to the PC clipboard.
.SS Devices
.TP 16
.B s
Search for devices on the network.
.TP
.B i
Turn "Share internet" on or off (its QR code is shown while it is on).
.TP
.BR N " / " P
Change the network name or password.
.TP
.B G
Generate a random password.
.TP
.B A
If the PC's Wi-Fi channel cannot be used: switch to another antenna of the
same network and turn it on.
.TP
.B E
Send the network to the phone.
.TP
.B u
Turn internet over the USB cable on or off.
.SS Send
.TP 16
.B e
Type the file path.
.TP
.B Enter
Send it to the phone over Bluetooth.
.SS Camera & mic
.TP 16
.BR "\(ua \(da"
Pick a camera.
.TP
.B Enter
Turn the webcam on or off.
.TP
.B p
Webcam engine: automatic, v4l2loopback or PipeWire.
.TP
.B m
Turn the microphone on or off.
.TP
.B d
Use the phone microphone as the default input.
.SS QR codes
.TP 16
.B s
Open the scanner on the phone.
.TP
.B Enter
Open (if it is a web page) or copy.
.TP
.B c
Copy.
.TP
.B g
Save to Downloads.
.TP
.B x
Delete from the history.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KUSHARE_LANG
Language
.RB ( es ", " en ).
See
.BR kushare (1).
